{title: 236 - I Love Thee}
{artist: Seventh-day Adventist Hymnal}
{lyricist: }
{composer: }
{key: Eb}
{time: 4/4}
{tempo: Moderato}
{tag: Jesus Christ}
{tag: }

Verse 1:
[Gm]I [Cm/G]love Thee, [Eb/Bb]I love Thee, I love Thee,my [Bb]Lord;
[Eb/Bb]I love [Gm]Thee, [Cm/G]my Savior, [Eb]I love Thee, my God.
[Gm]I love [Fm/Ab]Thee, I [Cm/G]love [Gm]Thee, and that Thou dost [Eb]know;
[Cm]But how much I love [Eb]Thee my actions [Adim]will [Bb]show.

Verse 2:
[Gm]I'm [Cm/G]happy, [Eb/Bb]I'm happy, O, wondrous account!
[Eb/Bb]My joys [Gm]are [Cm/G]immortal, [Eb]I stand on the mount!
[Gm]I gaze [Fm/Ab]on my [Cm/G]treasure [Gm]and long to be [Eb]there,
[Cm]With Jesus and angels, [Eb/Bb]and kindred [Adim]so [Bb]dear.

Verse 3:
[Gm]O [Cm/G]Jesus, [Eb/Bb]my Savior, with Thee I am [Bb]blest,
[Eb/Bb]My life [Gm]and [Cm/G]salvation, [Eb]my joy and my rest:
[Gm]Thy name [Fm/Ab]be my [Cm/G]theme, [Gm]and Thy love be my [Eb]song;
[Cm]Thy grace shall inspire [Eb]both my heart [Adim]and my [Bb]tongue.

Verse 4:
[Gm]O, [Cm/G]who's like [Eb/Bb]my Savior? He's Salem's bright [Bb]King;
[Eb/Bb]He smiles, [Cm/G]and He loves [Eb]me, and helps me to sing.
[Gm]I'll praise [Fm/Ab]Him, I'll [Cm/G]praise Him, [Gm]with notes loud and [Eb]clear
[Cm]While rivers of pleasure [Eb/Bb]my spirit [Adim]do [Bb]cheer.
